WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.458
Step 1: Open Admin → Users and choose Create user. The User setup popup tracks each step as you complete it.

2
00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:19.292
Step 2: Set up Name &amp; email, then Phone &amp; clock PIN. Add their phone number for clock/kiosk access, or choose Skip for now. The last four phone digits must be unique across the network.

3
00:00:19.292 --> 00:00:27.042
Step 3: Review Permissions, including whether they apply to this company or the network, then choose accessible Locations and a default location.

4
00:00:27.042 --> 00:00:36.667
Step 4: Choose Review invitation, check the details and press Send invitation. Only this action creates the account and sends its password setup link. Check the delivery result.

5
00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:55.042
Step 5: After creating the user, open Roster details. Choose Pay Conditions and preview Pay Rates underneath. For part-time staff, Add regular working hours opens the optional hours form; complete shift costs need these hours or a recorded current IFA permitting roster-based hours. Save employment details, then Continue and Finish user setup, or skip for now.

6
00:00:55.042 --> 00:01:09.667
Step 6: Use the pencil beside a user, then choose Personal, Pay Conditions, Time &amp; Attendance or Leave &amp; Availability. Groups keep unsaved fields. Save account details, photos and employment terms with their own Save actions. Sign in again after access or sign-in changes.
